      "observed": "On the DISPLAY sheet (display.kicad_sch), the pull-up resistor R4 on the DISP_RES / RES# line is drawn with the value '10M' (10 M\u03a9), tied between VCC and U4 pin 14 (RES#).",
      "expected": "The specification states R4 is a 10 k\u03a9 pull-up: 'DISP_RES: U2 pin 33 (PB12) \u2014 R4 (10 k\u03a9) to VCC \u2014 U4 pin 14 (RES#), active-low reset held high by R4's pull-up'. A 10 M\u03a9 value is three orders of magnitude too large.",
